      ],
      "source": "https://www.uncovercolorado.com/towns/kiowa/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Kiowa became the county seat of Elbert County in 1874, cementing its role in local governance.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
